!!<*yamlover: $defs: chapter>
YAML 1.1 words
description: 'yaml/bool11 — yes, no, on, off (opt-in vocabulary)'
- >
  `yes` / `no` / `on` / `off` — YAML 1.1 only, not core. The reader follows the YAML 1.2 core schema,
  where these are ordinary strings; the notation is reserved vocabulary, classified the moment a
  reader opts in.
